      "message": "Our device may not specific set the value but use default value of net.tcp.default_init_rwnd properties. The value could also be configured or customized using Settings.Global.TCP_DEFAULT_INIT_RWND. OEMs may configure/update the system property or setting provider for their need, so we may not able to just replace it with a hardcode in init.rc.",
